{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S11、S12等短停留段落中，左侧叙述偏长，边听边扫不如X利落；右侧感受也压缩了X贴合具体音型变化的细节。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y把“想念什么、为什么动摇、为何不回头、怎样继续生活”连成了比较清楚的因果链，尤其S06、S07和S11—S13，普通观众更容易明白人物每次转折的来由，也更容易感到整个故事在向一个方向发展。X的短句、重点放大和按音乐小节出现的感受更利于扫读，音乐细节也更细腻具体，但感受层层铺开时，人物动机和整段叙事需要观众自己拼接。综合而言，我更愿意选Y，因为它让观众不仅感受到人物难受，还能明白他为什么难受、为什么犹豫，以及最后为什么作出这样的选择。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "93ecc73c-9fbc-4f82-a2a6-8b548d6ed75d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T224020879301Z", "elapsed_seconds": 64.0, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T22:41:24.909427+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "771e0588c7ad157b8d97c9283b8dfa9c7c2b435783fde7953f8b88c5503b578c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4